          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthembi Asalia alika amũatĩĩe, e na athembi mĩongo nyanya ma Yeova, andũ ngũmbaũ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mamũkan’ya mũsumbĩ Usia, na mamwĩa, Ti wĩa waku, Usia, kũmũtoeesya Yeova ũvani, ĩndĩ nĩ wa athembi na ana ma Aluni, ala mavathanĩtw’e methĩwe atheu matoeeasye ũvani: uma ĩkalũnĩ; nũndũ nũvĩtĩtye; o na ũu ndũkethĩwa ndaĩa kwaku kuma kwa Yeova Ngai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
